 "intro_zh": "大沼泽国家公园位于佛罗里达州最南端，被称为是“从内陆流向大海的绿地之河”。国家公园中有大量的水域面积，为许多鸟类和爬行动物提供了栖息地，同时也是如海牛这样的濒危动物的庇护所。",
 "intro_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "intro_en": "This site at the southern tip of Florida has been called 'a river of grass flowing imperceptibly from the hinterland into the sea'. The exceptional variety of its water habitats has made it a sanctuary for a large number of birds and reptiles, as well as for threatened species such as the manatee.",
 "intro_en_source": "unesco_official",
